      "fingerprint": "bb0020177dec2a23582e9de7f46b9821dad7c6b8d62c88c8c49332440ef51b0a",
      "kind": "editorial",
      "status": "blocked",
      "issues": [
        "- Water image clock formula (6:30 − time for ≤6:30, 18:30 − time for >6:30) gives incorrect results for boundary times: e.g., 12:00 yields 6:30 (correct is 6:00), 6:30 yields 12:00 (correct is 11:30) → The mental flip method (swap 12↔6, keep 3↔9, flip hands vertically) is the correct reliable method; the formula should not be presented without exceptions."
      ],
